WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.700
GameDay Huddle. Build the playbook. Call it on game day.

00:04.700 --> 00:09.550
One system for the whole week: playbook, game day, roster, and analytics stay connected.

00:09.550 --> 00:14.400
Build what you coach. Organize formations and calls around your football system.

00:14.400 --> 00:19.250
Draw the play your way with routes, blocks, motions, gaps, and player responsibilities.

00:19.250 --> 00:24.100
